  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It remains inside one of the fallen tree tunnels and keeps the adult Striped Bark Scorpion's moveset: close-range combos, tail attacks, and a strong tendency to burrow and strike from underground.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "Its location can catch the player completely off guard. You may enter the tunnel after spending health and resources on the many creatures outside, only to suddenly run into an O.G.R.R. capable of ending the fight very quickly.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "The area around its hiding place is full of threats such as earwigs, Toe Biters, spiders, and other creatures. They may not necessarily join the actual fight, but they can weaken you before you reach the scorpion or follow you to the tunnel entrance.",
  "strategy": "The biggest problem is the lack of mobility inside the tunnel. Do not rush in: kill or avoid nearby creatures first, recover health, and prepare your resources before advancing. Check its infusion and use Fresh → Sour, Sour → Spicy, or Spicy → Fresh, preferably combined with Busting damage. Inside the tunnel, avoid getting cornered and be especially careful when it burrows, because the narrow space severely limits your dodging options.",
